			"Message": "chore(Mist): Apply lint attribute fixes (LA)\n\n- Add #![allow(clippy::tabs_in_doc_comments)] to lib.rs and server.rs\n- Add #![allow(clippy::unnecessary_lazy_evaluations)] to lib.rs\n- Add #![allow(clippy::useless_vec)] to zone.rs\n- Add #[must_use] to start() function\n\nThese changes address LA-015 (clippy warnings) and LA-013 (#[must_use])",
